<title>USA: Ames stake cut by DDJ Capital to 4.15 pct.</title>
<headline>Ames stake cut by DDJ Capital to 4.15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group includng DDJ Capital Management said Friday it cut its stake in Ames Department Stores Inc. to 850,150 shares or 4.15 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 451,600 shares between Feb. 14 and March 21.</p>
</text>
